[ti:Inside My Head]
[ar:mippithedork]
[offset:0]

[00:02.00]Yeah...
[00:06.00]Whatever...
[00:19.00]Got a million-dollar vision
[00:22.00]Got it buried in my brain
[00:24.00]Everybody wants a document
[00:27.00]Everybody sounds the same
[00:29.00]Got a meeting in the morning
[00:32.00]Got a question every night
[00:34.00]They keep asking for direction
[00:37.00]Like they can't tell wrong from right
[00:39.00]You want a plan
[00:42.00]You want a page
[00:44.00]You want a box
[00:46.00]To build my cage
[00:48.00]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[00:51.00]DON'T NEED YOU TO QUESTION ME!
[00:53.00]IT'S ALL RIGHT HERE INSIDE MY HEAD!
[00:56.00]JUST BUILD THE THING I NEVER SAID!
[00:58.00]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[01:01.00]QUIT TRYING TO PUT YOUR RULES ON ME!
[01:03.00]YOU WANT A PLAN,
[01:04.00]YOU WANT A SIGN
[01:05.00]JUST MAKE THE GAME I HAVE IN MY MIND!
[01:12.00]Artist wants a reference
[01:15.00]Coder wants a spec
[01:17.00]Designer wants the numbers
[01:20.00]Producer wants a check
[01:22.00]I told 'em make it faster
[01:24.00]Now they say it's way too slow
[01:27.00]I told 'em make it darker
[01:29.00]They should know how dark to go
[01:32.00]You want the truth
[01:34.00]You want it clear
[01:36.00]I said it once
[01:39.00]Some time last year
[01:41.00]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[01:44.00]DON'T NEED YOU TO QUESTION ME!
[01:46.00]IT'S ALL RIGHT HERE INSIDE MY HEAD!
[01:48.00]JUST BUILD THE THING I NEVER SAID!
[01:51.00]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[01:53.00]QUIT TRYING TO PUT YOUR RULES ON ME!
[01:56.00]YOU WANT A PLAN,
[01:57.00]YOU WANT A SIGN
[01:58.00]JUST MAKE THE GAME I HAVE IN MY MIND!
[02:05.00]They built what I asked for
[02:07.00]Now they're acting all surprised
[02:10.00]I told 'em that's the old game
[02:12.00]Can't they see the vision's died?
[02:15.00]They showed me all the messages
[02:17.00]The things I used to say
[02:20.00]I told 'em that's called progress
[02:22.00]Things are different every day
[02:24.00]You write it down
[02:27.00]You make it law
[02:29.00]You kill the dream
[02:31.00]Before it draws
[02:34.00]Three different versions
[02:36.00]Of a game nobody knows
[02:39.00]Three different answers
[02:41.00]Everywhere the question goes
[02:43.00]What are we making? / Why can't you see it?
[02:46.00]What are we making? / Why can't you see?
[02:48.00]What are we making? / IT'S RIGHT IN FRONT OF ME!
[02:58.00]No paper!
[03:00.00]No rules!
[03:01.00]No meetings!
[03:02.00]No fools!
[03:03.00]No roadmap!
[03:04.00]No plan!
[03:05.00]No questions!
[03:06.00]JUST DO WHAT I SAID!
[03:08.00]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[03:10.00]DON'T NEED YOU TO QUESTION ME!
[03:13.00]IT'S ALL RIGHT HERE INSIDE MY HEAD!
[03:15.00]JUST BUILD THE THING I NEVER SAID!
[03:17.00]I DON'T NEED NO G D D!
[03:20.00]QUIT TRYING TO PUT YOUR RULES ON ME!
[03:22.00]YOU WANT A PLAN,
[03:23.00]YOU WANT A SIGN
[03:25.00]JUST MAKE THE GAME I HAVE IN MY MIND!
[03:32.00]Look, we just need something written down.
[03:35.00]Nobody knows what we're making anymore.
[03:37.00]Fine.
[03:41.00]Somebody write down what's in my head.
